From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 12:54:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] check_boot_jars: allow oplus-fwk OEM stub packages on the
 bootclasspath

The full crDroid boot-jars-package-check rejects hardware/oplus/oplus-fwk/
oplus-fwk.jar because OEM stub package namespaces are not in
package_allowed_list.txt.

Add the mandatory com.oplusx.* namespace. Also allow com.coloros.deepthinker,
com.itgsa.opensdk.wm and com.color.inner.view: infiniti builds prove
oplus-fwk.jar contains com.coloros.deepthinker.IColorDeepThinkerManager,
com.itgsa.opensdk.wm.ActivityMultiWindowAllowance and
com.color.inner.view.ViewWrapper on the bootclasspath.
---
 scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt b/scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt
--- a/scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt
+++ b/scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt
@@ -300,6 +300,20 @@ vendor\.oplus\..*
 com\.oneplus\..*
 vendor\.oneplus\..*
 
+# infiniti camera-port v3: oplus-fwk boot-jar OEM stub namespaces missing from crDroid base.
+# MANDATORY: com.oplusx.sysapi.cryptoeng is load-bearing for AIUnit CryptoengNative,
+# the cryptoeng HAL client, and FIDO attestation.
+# BUILD-PROVEN: oplus-fwk.jar exports com.coloros.deepthinker.IColorDeepThinkerManager
+# during the Marker-3 infiniti build boot-jar package check.
+com\.coloros\.deepthinker
+# BUILD-PROVEN: oplus-fwk.jar exports com.itgsa.opensdk.wm.ActivityMultiWindowAllowance
+# during the Marker-3 infiniti build boot-jar package check.
+com\.itgsa\.opensdk\.wm
+# BUILD-PROVEN: oplus-fwk.jar exports com.color.inner.view.ViewWrapper during the
+# 16.0.9 infiniti build boot-jar package check; port commit 1399c74e introduces it.
+com\.color\.inner\.view
+com\.oplusx\..*
+
 # QC adds
 com.qualcomm.qti
 com.quicinc.tcmiface
-- 
2.49.0
